  "long_description": "CareerTu is an online school for today’s most in-demand digital skills, starting with digital marketing, data analytics, and product design. We teach our students real-world business problems via capstone projects to make sure they are equipped with the must-have technical skills.\r\n\r\n250+ top companies hired CareerTu students in 14 countries - including Google,  Facebook, Microsoft, Amazon, Spotify,  Pinterest, LVMH, TikTok, Expedia, Alibaba, Tencent, Meituan etc. \r\n\r\nCareerTu's mission is to teach students the industry’s most relevant and in-demand skills, making them the ideal hire at their dream companies, in return providing businesses with experienced and reliable talents to increase their efficiency.\r\n\r\n华语数字化技能学习平台。通过系统学习高薪数字化技能, 迅速培养新兴行业紧缺的人，为全球14个国家的科技和新零售企业, 不断输送优秀人才。\r\n\r\n",
